=== og ===
og 0.0.4
Semantic code search — hybrid BM25 + vectors

Usage: og [FLAGS] [QUERY] [PATH] <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  build    Build or update index
  clean    Delete index
  context  Show ranked files and symbols for compact code context
  model    Embedding model management
  outline  Show block structure of an indexed file
  status   Show index status
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Arguments:
  [QUERY]  Search query or file reference (file#name, file:line)
  [PATH]   Directory to search
           (default: .)

Flags:
  -n <NUM_RESULTS>         Number of results
                           (default: 10)
  -j, --json               JSON output
  -l, --files-only         List files only
      --no-content         JSON output without content field
  -q, --quiet              Suppress progress
  -t, --type <TYPE>        Filter file types (py,js,ts)
      --exclude <EXCLUDE>  Exclude glob patterns
      --code-only          Exclude docs (md, txt, rst)
      --no-semantic        Disable the vector channel (BM25 + trigram only)
  -C, --context <CONTEXT>  Content preview lines (0 = none)
                           (default: 5)
  -e, --regex <REGEX>      Filter results by regex (applied to content and name)
      --highlight          Highlight query-related tokens in terminal previews
  -h, --help               Print help
  -V, --version            Print version

=== og build ===
Build or update index

Usage: og build [FLAGS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  Directory to index
          (default: .)

Flags:
      --deterministic  Use the deterministic test embedder (no model download;
                       no semantic signal)
  -f, --force          Force a full rebuild
  -q, --quiet          Suppress progress
  -h, --help           Print help

=== og status ===
Show index status

Usage: og status [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  Directory to check
          (default: .)

Flags:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== og clean ===
Delete index

Usage: og clean [-q --quiet] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  Directory
          (default: .)

Flags:
  -q, --quiet  Suppress the removal confirmation
  -h, --help   Print help

=== og outline ===
Show block structure of an indexed file

Usage: og outline [FLAGS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  File or directory to outline
          (default: .)

Flags:
  -j, --json                     JSON output
      --skeleton                 Output full function/class signatures without
                                 bodies
      --max-tokens <MAX_TOKENS>  Token budget for packed output (~4 chars/token)
                                 (default: 8000)
  -q, --quiet                    Suppress progress
  -h, --help                     Print help

=== og context ===
Show ranked files and symbols for compact code context

Usage: og context [FLAGS] [PATH]

Arguments:
  [PATH]  File or directory to summarize
          (default: .)

Flags:
  -n <NUM_FILES>                 Number of files to show
                                 (default: 12)
      --symbols <SYMBOLS>        Number of symbols per file
                                 (default: 5)
  -j, --json                     JSON output
      --skeleton                 Include skeleton snippets
      --max-tokens <MAX_TOKENS>  Token budget for packed output (~4 chars/token)
                                 (default: 8000)
  -q, --quiet                    Suppress progress
  -h, --help                     Print help

=== og model ===
Embedding model management

Usage: og model <SUBCOMMAND>

Commands:
  install  Download the default model
  status   Show model status
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Flags:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== og model status ===
Show model status

Usage: og model status

Flags:
  -h, --help  Print help

=== og model install ===
Download the default model

Usage: og model install

Flags:
  -h, --help  Print help
